  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9005.04 Additional Test Submission. Once an additional test taken pursuant to RSA 265-A:7 is submitted to the forensic science laboratory, the department shall hold it for 30 calendar days following receipt in the laboratory.\n\nSource. #12556, eff 6-21-18",
